The `vectors/valid/` directory is this repository's reference unsigned chain.
`vectors/tampered/` deliberately alters one member, `vectors/fabricated/`
contains fabricated content with a matching hash, and
`vectors/sample-receipt.json` is synthetic. These fixtures demonstrate the
tool's documented behavior; their inclusion does not establish provenance,
external publication, or third-party validation of their contents.
